    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-450546"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5f23a331a1648700152d71f5"
                id="word_commented_5f23a331a1648700152d71f5"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5f23a331a1648700152d71f5">
                    汪翔
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">23/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-450546"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL243221https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL243221at21%2FMay%2F2511%3A29AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-43221" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-43221</a> at 21/May/25 11:29 AM</h5>

<p><span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/356133" title="5-21.tar.gz attached to ECS-7317" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="5-21.tar.gz" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="5876d2c1-950e-47bd-8a4e-25e4ca0d23cb" rel="noreferrer">5-21.tar.gz<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/356132" alt="3bceb2ba995481573ac4894a3900e95d_-20250521-032914.jpg" height="1280" width="2279" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/356131" alt="290d50dad0bb042e9db2f660222a543f_-20250521-032905.jpg" height="1280" width="2279" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-450547"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">23/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-450547"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL243221https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL243221at22%2FMay%2F254%3A19PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-43221" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-43221</a> at 22/May/25 4:19 PM</h5>

<p>比较像是一个内核bug（<a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6301" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECS-6301</a> ），在kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_26中有fix。</p>

<p>这个bug 导致可能在中断或者软中断中意外丢失一次 rcu_sched 线程唤醒操作，导致无法启动新的宽限期，从而其他任何调用同步 rcu 的任务都会 D 住。5月19号 19:10后打印的D进程call trace都是卡在__wait_rcu_gp -&gt; wait_for_completion 这个点上。这可能导致后面积攒了越来越多的D进程，一方面内存占用量越来越高，另一方面从5月19号 19:28开始在一些容器、user session、根的cgroup pids控制器出现疑似pid达到上限的打印（cgroup: fork rejected by pids controller in /kubepods/besteffort/pod......），最后导致oom，虚机进程无法完成回收。</p>

<p><b>但是现场重启了节点，无法尝试导出vmcore，所以无法确定是否是此已知问题。</b></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-450548"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">23/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-450548"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL243221https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL243221at22%2FMay%2F254%3A22PM%2Clasteditedby%E9%99%88%E5%A5%87https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A1e1c47af84e443b88bc448b51d054387at23%2FMay%2F251%3A33PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-43221" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-43221</a> at 22/May/25 4:22 PM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">陈奇</a> at 23/May/25 1:33 PM</h5>

<p>由于没有故障现场，目前无法确认问题性质。已经和现场同事说明，后面如果复现，需要导出vmcore来确认，方法有两个：</p>

<ul>
	<li>从其他节点ipmitool sol activate后~~B</li>
	<li>从带外点击“发送nmi”（如果有）</li>
</ul>


<p>此case先关闭。</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-450549"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">23/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

