        <tr id="comment-body-450550"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL243221https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL243221at23%2FMay%2F2511%3A14AM%2Clasteditedby%E6%B1%AA%E7%BF%94https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F5f23a331a1648700152d71f5at23%2FMay%2F2511%3A15AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-43221" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-43221</a> at 23/May/25 11:14 AM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/5f23a331a1648700152d71f5" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">汪翔</a> at 23/May/25 11:15 AM</h5>

<p>故障已经出现两次了，之前尝试使用魔术键也没有生成vmcore，硬件侧认为没告警且没有nmi功能，需要系统侧调查，现在的问题是如何答复客户并且如何尽可能避免再发生，出现问题的均是中兴服务器，是否可以根绝这个线索协调硬件排查</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-450551"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
